WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.272
Later that evening Ben was eating dinner with his family.

2
00:00:11.273 --> 00:00:14.168
"How was school today?" Ben's father asked.

3
00:00:14.169 --> 00:00:17.043
"Were monsters getting ready for the pet show?"

4
00:00:17.044 --> 00:00:23.873
"Yes," Ben said. "When I signed up to volunteer, I got to see some cool pets.

5
00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:27.104
The real show takes place tomorrow and Saturday."

6
00:00:27.105 --> 00:00:33.464
He told his family about the obedience, tricks, and best pet competitions.

7
00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:37.456
"I hope you're not shopping for a pet," his mother said.

8
00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:41.263
Ben took another bite of creeploaf and didn't answer.

9
00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:44.719
But his brother Sid's ears had perked up.

10
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.781
"Can we get a pet, Mom? Please?"

11
00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:49.748
His mother looked at Ben.

12
00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:53.509
"Please pass the spoiled eggs, Ben. The slime sauce too."

13
00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.337
Ben passed the food as Sid tried another approach.

14
00:00:57.338 --> 00:01:00.091
"Can I at least go to the pet show?" he asked.

15
00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:03.287
"I want to see some cool pets too."

16
00:01:03.288 --> 00:01:06.875
"Maybe we can all go to the show together," Ben's dad suggested.

17
00:01:06.876 --> 00:01:10.448
He put a big pile of fried bat wings on his plate.

18
00:01:10.449 --> 00:01:16.049
"Sid's right. It would be interesting to see the pets—and it could be a fun family outing."

19
00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:23.271
Ben's mother shook her head. "I don't know if that's such a good idea."

20
00:01:23.272 --> 00:01:26.231
"I know you don't like dogs, Mom," Ben said.

21
00:01:26.232 --> 00:01:28.888
"But there will be other pets at the show."

22
00:01:28.889 --> 00:01:33.203
She shuddered. "I can't stand most animals.

23
00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:35.947
Uncle Edgar's bird gives me the creeps.

24
00:01:35.948 --> 00:01:44.590
Aunt Petunia's stinkworm makes her house smell terrible, and the neighbors' tarantula is always digging up our backyard!"

25
00:01:44.591 --> 00:01:47.002
Ben's father put down his fork.

26
00:01:47.003 --> 00:01:50.316
"Maybe Ben, Sid, and I will go to the show," he said.

27
00:01:50.317 --> 00:01:52.611
"You can stay home, honey."

28
00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:59.192
"You're forgetting something," she said. "Sid is allergic to some animals."

29
00:01:59.193 --> 00:02:01.791
"It's okay, Mom," Sid said quickly.

30
00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:04.184
"I just break out in green spots.

31
00:02:04.185 --> 00:02:07.025
Green spots are a little itchy, but they look cool!

32
00:02:07.034 --> 00:02:11.847
I'll put up with hundreds of green spots, if it means we can have a pet."

33
00:02:11.848 --> 00:02:15.786
"Good one, Sid!" Ben thought, glancing hopefully at his mother.

34
00:02:15.787 --> 00:02:18.486
But her lips were tightly pursed.

35
00:02:18.487 --> 00:02:22.087
"We're not getting a pet," she said firmly.

36
00:02:22.088 --> 00:02:27.062
"Right now we are only talking about pets—and the pet show."

37
00:02:27.063 --> 00:02:30.830
"Where we can definitely find a pet that you'll like!" Ben said.

38
00:02:30.831 --> 00:02:35.527
"I'll be at the show all weekend long. It's a great opportunity!"

39
00:02:35.528 --> 00:02:40.199
Sid clapped his hands. "Yeah!" "Boys,

40
00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.458
that's not what I said." Ben's

41
00:02:42.459 --> 00:02:49.393
mother closed her eyes and took a deep breath. Then

42
00:02:49.394 --> 00:02:51.562
she opened them again. "Okay,

43
00:02:51.563 --> 00:02:55.693
I'll think about it. But I'm making no promises." "I

44
00:02:55.694 --> 00:02:58.837
can help Ben look at pets at the show," Sid said. "We'll

45
00:02:58.838 --> 00:03:03.573
do a simple test. If I don't get green spots, I'm not allergic." Their

46
00:03:03.574 --> 00:03:07.690
mother tapped a finger on the table. "Hmm . . ." "We

47
00:03:07.691 --> 00:03:11.483
can at least let the boys look around at the show," their father said. "There's

48
00:03:11.484 --> 00:03:13.902
no harm in that." "Please,

49
00:03:13.903 --> 00:03:18.219
Mom," Ben pleaded softly. "All

50
00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.604
right," she said at last. "You

51
00:03:20.605 --> 00:03:24.872
two can look." She stared hard at Ben. "But

52
00:03:24.873 --> 00:03:29.906
if Sid starts sneezing or itching a lot, you have to bring him home immediately." "Bring

53
00:03:29.907 --> 00:03:32.287
him home?" Ben repeated. "Yes,"

54
00:03:32.288 --> 00:03:34.410
his mother said. "I'll

55
00:03:34.411 --> 00:03:37.788
drop Sid off at Monster Academy tomorrow after school. You

56
00:03:37.789 --> 00:03:39.633
can keep an eye on him." "Oh,

57
00:03:39.634 --> 00:03:43.786
boy!" Sid shouted. "This is going to be great!" "But

58
00:03:43.787 --> 00:03:48.569
I have volunteer stuff to do at the show," Ben moaned. Besides,

59
00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:52.334
he wanted to hang out with his friends. "Sid

60
00:03:52.335 --> 00:03:55.443
can help you with the duties," his mother said. "I'm

61
00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:57.329
sure he won't get in the way." "But—"

62
00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.052
Ben's

63
00:03:58.053 --> 00:04:00.930
father cut him off with a stern look. "A

64
00:04:00.931 --> 00:04:04.969
ghost who wants a pet needs to show responsibility, Ben. So

65
00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.978
you should certainly be able to take care of your little brother for a few hours without difficulty." Ben

66
00:04:09.979 --> 00:04:19.955
was trapped. "Okay," he said with a heavy sigh. ***

67
00:04:19.956 --> 00:04:25.686
When Ben arrived at Monster Academy the next day, he grinned at the unusual scene.

68
00:04:25.687 --> 00:04:29.040
As always, monsters were streaming into the school building.

69
00:04:29.041 --> 00:04:33.428
But today some of them had brought their pets with them.

70
00:04:33.429 --> 00:04:37.805
Mr. Freaky stood outside, blowing his noses.

71
00:04:37.806 --> 00:04:40.353
"Now, students. Remember what I said:

72
00:04:40.354 --> 00:04:43.833
This afternoon you'll have an opportunity to work with your pets.

73
00:04:43.834 --> 00:04:47.658
Until then, let's keep everything under control!"

74
00:04:47.659 --> 00:04:52.969
Ben looked around. Gaby had her giant albino shrew.

75
00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:55.501
A vampire had brought a spider.

76
00:04:55.502 --> 00:05:03.935
Jen had her singing slug, and Cleo was towing a pet jackal with a leash.

77
00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:07.310
"Lucky Deb," Ben thought as he gazed at the pets.

78
00:05:07.311 --> 00:05:10.393
She had a funny piranha-keet that she had taught to speak.

79
00:05:10.394 --> 00:05:12.277
"Wrawck!" the bird squawked.

80
00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:21.744
"Everything is totally under control!"

